    <!-- Terms &amp; Conditions -->
    <string name="terms_title">Terms of Use</string>
    <string name="terms_body">Read these terms before you continue. By tapping Agree you accept the following:\n\n• Numify names incoming, outgoing and unknown callers as the call happens.\n• The app flags spam, scam and fraud numbers and helps you block them.\n• You can search any phone number for the caller details we have on file.\n• Call log and contacts access is needed for the app to label your calls.\n• The display-over-other-apps permission lets caller details appear during a call.\n• Your data stays on your side and is used only for caller ID and spam protection.\n\nTapping “Agree &amp; Continue” confirms you have read and accept our Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.</string>
